        // the percentage denominator is: ONE_HUNDRED_PERCENT = 10000
        // the actual fraction is: percentageNumerator / ONE_HUNDRED_PERCENT
        // e.g. percentageNumerator for 50% is 5000, because 5000 / 10000 = 0.5
